		BUGS
		====

Cylindrical symmetry particle iterator hangs in some loop with large
number of particles. Fills all of memory. Probably particle close to
the axis causes problems. Even no fields \phi=const. causes the problem.

End of electrode at the end of electrode causes solver not to converge.
Example: /home/tvkalvas/Work/Benchmark_Hanke/3D/Simulation_of_LEBT

